      "type": "MCQ",
      "text": "$\\sec A+\\tan A=\\sqrt5$ হলে $\\sin A$ কত?\n![চিত্র; মাপানুযায়ী নয়](https://proshnobook.com/question-bank/ssc-math-ch9-v1/source-dhaka-20.svg)",
      "options": {
        "A": "$\\sqrt5$",
        "B": "$\\frac32$",
        "C": "$\\frac23$",
        "D": "$\\frac1{\\sqrt5}$"
      },
      "correct": "C",
      "explanation": "$\\sec^2 A-\\tan^2 A=1$ থেকে $\\sec A-\\tan A=1/\\sqrt5$। যোগ-বিয়োগ করে $\\sin A=\\tan A/\\sec A=(5-1)/(5+1)=2/3$।",
      "page": "সংকলন: মুদ্রিত 142; PDF 1; প্রশ্ন 20",
